    "briefing": "Adelaide, October 1986, the title decider. Mansell has 70 points, Prost 64, Piquet 63: third place makes Mansell champion. Fuel is limited to 195 litres. Pit boards only, no radio. Reconstructed race: no lap timing survives, so the laps are rebuilt from the results and race reports. Who led each lap is sourced; the lap times are reconstructed.",
